                        "review": "Stray is fantastic and one of those games where I just can't put it into words.\r\n\r\nIt's not a long game, it's not mechanically difficult or complex. But it has me feeling for the Cat and the robots throughout. You wander through a beautiful, broken cybercity and slowly unravel what happened to the world below. \r\n\r\nI highly highly recommend this game because despite stressful moments - playing as a Cat is so relaxing and there's moments that hit hard and I feel like it represents what the world is turning into these days.\r\n\r\n9/10\r\n\r\n",
